# [COMMENT]: Dev-only credentials mirror production ACL shape. Production values come from Secret mounts.
user default off
user health on >aurora-dev-health-secret -@all +ping resetkeys resetchannels
user acr on >aurora-dev-acr-secret +@all -@dangerous +eval +evalsha ~iam:* ~billing:* ~ratelimit:* ~authz:* resetchannels
user controlplane on >aurora-dev-controlplane-secret +@all -@dangerous +eval +evalsha ~authz:* ~auth:revocation:* resetchannels &authz.invalidate.*
user cost on >aurora-dev-cost-secret +@all -@dangerous +eval +evalsha ~authz:* ~auth:proof:cost:* resetchannels &authz.invalidate.*
